        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize will compete with currently approved therapies and new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 34782,
        "end_character": 34957
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For clinical supply, we rely on CDMOs to manufacture drug substance and drug product in accordance with the FDA’s current Good Manufacturing Practices, or cGMP.",
        "start_character": 52229,
        "end_character": 52389
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given the overlapping biology, phenotypic presentation and clinical execution considerations, we believe that developing a portfolio of drugs to treat DEEs will create a distinct body of knowledge that can be leveraged within our operating ecosystem to develop meaningful therapies for this group of patients with devastating unmet clinical needs.",
        "start_character": 20384,
        "end_character": 20731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Led by our clinical-stage product candidate, elsunersen, for SCN2A early-onset DEE, Solidus™ has also generated three novel ASOs with preclinical proof of mechanism that we expect to nominate development candidates for in the first half of 2026 — PRAX-080 targeting PCDH19 mosaic expression disorders;",
        "start_character": 3347,
        "end_character": 3648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The RogCon Agreement, unless earlier terminated, will continue until the latest of: (i) the expiration of all patent rights within RogCon patents, (ii) we certify we have abandoned the research, development and commercialization of product with no intention to re-establish such activities and (iii) no third party is obligated to pay any amounts that comprise net sublicense revenue.",
        "start_character": 47597,
        "end_character": 47981
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Upon termination by us for convenience, we will stop selling all products, subject to certain wind-down provisions and all products will revert back to Ionis.",
        "start_character": 51801,
        "end_character": 51959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to rely on third parties for our manufacturing processes and the production of all clinical supply drug substance and drug product and currently expect to continue to do so for commercial supplies of our product candidates, if approved.",
        "start_character": 52390,
        "end_character": 52636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We use additional contract manufacturers to fill, label, package, store and distribute our investigational drug products and currently expect to continue to do so for commercial supplies of our product candidates, if approved.",
        "start_character": 52637,
        "end_character": 52863
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While it is unclear whether and how such policies will be implemented, the proposed policies are likely to have a negative impact on the pharmaceutical industry and on our ability to receive adequate revenues for any product candidates we develop, if approved.",
        "start_character": 93019,
        "end_character": 93279
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In September 2019, we and Ionis entered into the Ionis Agreement to discover and develop ASOs to treat forms of epilepsy caused by mutations of the SCN2A gene.",
        "start_character": 48308,
        "end_character": 48467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "It is through our two platforms, Cerebrum™ and Solidus™, that we aim to translate these insights into the discovery, development and potential commercialization of clinically meaningful medicines for patients.",
        "start_character": 4963,
        "end_character": 5172
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001689548-26-000029",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001689548-26-000029-1cce38fb1c431f64",
        "accession_number": "0001689548-26-000029",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our approach to building a robust clinical pipeline provides a forum for exploration and innovation where we are all involved in building the company together.",
        "start_character": 125645,
        "end_character": 125804
      }
